# The residues' loop computes from the index alone, so its body only
# computes and it is structured; after the vectorization it runs on the
# target's lanes, and that idr-narrow-lanes leaves those lanes 64-bit is
# what the output shows: the 64-bit residues expected-stdout holds. The
# structuring and the vectorization each run over the functions in a
# group, which dumps no module: each property is read at the first step
# after its group.
idr-bufferize: structured-loops
idr-returned-arguments: vectorized
